{"content_html": "<html><body><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span><a href=\"javascript:;\" title=\"TIN MỚI\">TIN MỚI</a></span>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>  Hiện trạng hai căn hộ tuy không quá xuống cấp nhưng bố cục kiểu cũ đem lại cảm giác nhàm chán và bí bách. Hiện trạng này vừa là thách thức nhưng cũng vừa là cơ hội để NTK thỏa sức sáng tạo. </p> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df73ab6d0c8cb53ef7b6a6b0ee36d8af9f0/1000037579.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7e1e8f4aecbdd446f7616bfb568e19ea2/1000037581.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7716ccbe3d7887c48cb122a679ffa6fb9/1000037583.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7fe11698bea1fb1f11d5436b8a72ff923/1000037585.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <p>  Các công việc cải tạo bao gồm, phá bỏ và thay mới trần cũ, mở rộng cửa sổ, thay đổi thiết kế khu vực vệ sinh, phá bỏ một phần tường ngăn thay bằng kính để ánh sáng tự nhiên từ cửa sổ lớn có thể tràn vào và cuối cùng là lựa chọn phối kết các món đồ nội thất rời thành một tổ hợp hài hòa thống nhất. </p> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7ec54e63358ac53a31d9b5a9a53b04e04/1000037587.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df736069941efaa2548f245b7906b6e1e01/1000037580.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7f31c1a6e52b0764b4b2c45b421d5b270/1000037582.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df73a5d72ac23b0441729e6f439ad738532/1000037586.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df73aeae713e72d720bee964d29ac117e8a/1000037600.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7201ca8d30b71c6d09d13a60564b73878/1000037601.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7dbc0dd94fbd80dc9f1cd3064b53ff9d2/1000037602.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7a1b1cbbbd5a07aa7475d3f88def1ea4e/1000037603.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7d13659343aa7f7287137992be6b5ddda/1000037606.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7d39220b69d8f0171750fe87219d59235/1000037605.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7dc9d78503f3ad41f076197839021f69e/1000037604.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df77bb83171229f3b5c620eaa6e26f3f388/1000037608.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <p>  Các căn hộ được thiết kế với tông màu có sắc độ trầm (muted) ấm áp, có chiều sâu, mang cảm giác sống động nhưng không chói mắt, gợi lên không khí của những căn hộ châu Âu được cải tạo theo phong cách đương đại. </p> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7157a74a0220b5bee61e0e6e5c07ae025/1000037589.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df77d399a109f492bfbcb78138d04c54767/1000037592.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7d5a9cdf79f045b3600fa97e3555bda64/1000037593.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7ed17036f8ee56c4227fbe05750672d74/1000037594.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7d05cc502933de62d1bd2e4a8263c3b82/1000037595.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df748fd834034601c186885abc861ef5b06/1000037596.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7e0b109da3e6296e1837b82c4ad52c85e/1000037607.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df73ad0e2ced4ea41fb00423a083989dd65/1000037610.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7bd982040687e8289412a036597547261/1000037609.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7254f54a9f5f443429b9d5319dde5fd51/1000037599.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df7060c1d7651bc5f8da58c4cca5f6bd6b3/1000037590.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure> <figure> <div> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/eab8b646a89980b0d6c6a8534eb7e38532042d893c1f89417d33f9901d450df779314aff6e31da735401d6138cebca40/1000037584.jpg.avif\" title=\"\"/> </div> <figcaption></figcaption> </figure>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>"}